      "message": "But a function should do what the name says. We should add a new function:\n\n     * Wrap a byte[] into a String using UTF-8.\n     */\n    public static String toUtfString(byte[] bytes) {\n        try {\n            return new String(bytes, CharacterSets.MIMENAME_UTF_8);\n        } catch (UnsupportedEncodingException e) {\n            // Impossible to reach here!\n            Log.e(TAG, \"UTF-8 must be supported!\", e);\n            return \"\";\n        }\n    }\n\nWe should also update the documentation on this function:\n\nWrap a byte[] into a String using ISO-8859-1. See also {@link #toUtfString(byte[])}.\n\nAnd then we should change the callsites to use toUtfString instead.",
